    "preamble": "Mrs.G.V.Kasthuri vs Unknown on 8 October, 2025 Author: D.Bharatha Chakravarthy Bench: D.Bharatha Chakravarthy In The High Court Of Judicature At Madras Dated: 08.10.2025 Coram: The Honourable Mr. Justice D.Bharatha Chakravarthy Suo Motu TR.No.19659 of 2025 (STC.No.672 of 2022 of Judicial Magistrate Court, Dharapuram, Dharapu Taluk, Tiruppur)",
    "facts": "This case is registered for alleged offences under Section 58 & 59(i) of Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006. The allegation in this case is that in the shop belonging to Accused no.1, the banned tobacco products of Cool Lip Filter Tobacco and Ganesh - tobacco 60 packets were found. Accordingly, the case was filed as against the manufacturers of the said tobacco products being the Accused Nos.2 and 3. Unless specific allegations are made, that they only directly supplied to Accused No.1., case cannot stand against A2 and A3, since the tobacco products is not banned in the respective States in which they are manufacturing. https://www.mhc.tn.gov.in/judis",
